            <div xml:id="d586">

                <pb facs="0808" n="709" sameAs="frus:frus1936v05/pg709"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.52/2065a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Daniels</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-12-12T16:00:00-05:00">December 12, 1936—4
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>217. Your 211 December 11, 1 p.m.<anchor n="23" xml:id="d586-f1"/> In your
                    forthcoming conference with the President of Mexico the Department authorizes
                    you in your discretion to discuss the Yaqui Valley situation, being guided by
                    your knowledge of the status of the proposals submitted by the landowners.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Moore</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
